==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Great Angel Chibinel]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**4 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

